 "description": "Retrieve the current published Reliability Score rankings. Broker scores and Carrier & MGA scores are ranked separately; the directory also shows a combined score, the average of the two. Partial scores and unrated assessments keep their qualifications. Use search_provider_reliability for provider, score, and status filters. Optional need runs a bounded editorial judgment over the published tables only.",
